      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate and dedicated veterinary staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently praise the veterinary team at Bay Glen Animal Hospital for their professionalism, warmth, and attentive bedside manner. Reviewers highlight Dr. Delgado, Dr. Goldsberry, and the veterinary technicians for listening carefully to concerns, creating clear treatment plans, and treating family pets like their own."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for anxious pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently emphasize the gentle, patient care shown toward nervous dogs and stressed cats during exams. Reviewers appreciate that the clinical team takes extra time to soothe fearful animals with treats and positive reinforcement, making routine wellness visits and nail trims significantly less stressful for pets."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Thorough explanations and responsive follow-up"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers appreciate the thorough communication provided by both veterinarians and front desk personnel. Pet parents note that doctors take time to explain diagnostic findings and vaccination schedules clearly, while bilingual staff members accommodate Spanish-speaking pet owners during consultations."
      }
    }
  ],
